/span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">avgdl</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.68em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.127em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.29em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(t,d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是词频，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|d|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 是该字段长度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>avgdl</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{avgdl}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">avgdl</span></span></span></span></span></span> 是平均字段长度，二者都来自段的 norms 文件（<code>.nvd/.nvm</code>，每个文档一个字节的量化长度）。IDF 为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>idf</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{idf}(t) = \\ln\\!\\left(1+\\frac{N-n_t+0.5}{n_t+0.5}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">idf</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 是全索引文档数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是含该 term 的文档数——这也是为什么 <code>Weight</code> 必须构造时就读统计量：它能把这些与段无关的量算好，段内只做一次乘加。</p>\n<p>打分不是每个候选都要算完。对多个 <code>SHOULD</code> 的并集查询，Lucene 实现 <strong>WAND / block-max WAND</strong>：为每个 clause 维护一个分数上界 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ub</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>idf</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ub}(t) = \\text{idf}(t)\\cdot(k_1+1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ub</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">idf</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，当「上界之和」已低于当前 Top-K 队列的阈值分数时，整块文档可以跳过而不逐条打分。这套算法自 Lucene 8.0 起默认启用，官方在 <a href=\"https://www.elastic.co/blog/whats-new-in-lucene-8-0\">Elastic 的 Lucene 8 发布说明</a> 中记录了它对低选择性并集查询的加速。跳过的前提是<strong>打分函数单调可上界</strong>——这也解释了为什么自定义 <code>Similarity</code> 必须能被安全上界，否则 WAND 会退化为全量打分。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>相似度</th>\n<th>核心量</th>\n<th>是否含文档长度归一</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>BM25Similarity</code></td>\n<td>IDF + 饱和 TF + 长度归一</td>\n<td>是（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 控制）</td>\n<td>默认全文检索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>BooleanSimilarity</code></td>\n<td>仅命中/未命中</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td><code>constant_score</code>、<code>FILTER</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ClassicSimilarity</code></td>\n<td>tf-idf 向量空间</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>需要旧打分兼容时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义 Similarity</td>\n<td>任意</td>\n<td>视实现</td>\n<td>必须提供可上界，否则失去跳过</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"两阶段收集-topscoredoccollector-与字段回取\">两阶段收集：TopScoreDocCollector 与字段回取</h2><p>「收集」在 Lucene 里分两层，这也是本文标题里「两阶段」的含义。<strong>第一层</strong>是打分收集：<code>TopScoreDocCollector</code> 内部维护一个容量为 <code>numHits</code>（通常是 <code>from + size</code>）的 <code>PriorityQueue</code>，堆顶是当前<strong>最低</strong>的候选分数，即阈值。<code>collect(docId)</code> 只做一次比较——低于阈值直接丢弃，高于阈值才入堆并挤出堆顶；因为绝大多数命中在第一关就被丢掉，<code>score()</code> 和堆操作的成本被压到与 <code>size</code> 相关而非命中总数相关。</p>\n<p><code>PriorityQueue</code> 的比较器有两级：先比分数，分数相等时比 docID（更小的文档号优先），这保证了 <code>search_after</code> 与分页的<strong>确定性</strong>——否则同一分数下不同分片的排序会漂移，翻页出现重复或遗漏。<code>TopDocs</code> 最终只装 <code>(docID, score)</code> 对，不含任何字段值。</p>\n<p><strong>第二层</strong>是字段回取。<code>TopDocs</code> 里的 docID 是「全局文档号」，要拿到 <code>_source</code>，必须回到段的 stored fields 文件 <code>.fdt</code>（数据）与 <code>.fdx</code>（指针）里按 docID 解压。Elasticsearch 把这两层显式拆成两个阶段：协调节点先跑 <strong>Query Phase</strong> 收集各分片的 <code>TopDocs</code> 并归并成全局 Top-K，再跑 <strong>Fetch Phase</strong> 只针对这 K 个文档向相关分片发 <code>mget</code> 式的取回请求（见 <a href=\"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/search-your-data.html\">Elasticsearch 搜索阶段文档</a>）。这个拆分是关键优化：字段解压是昂贵且不可并行的 IO，而排序只需 docID 与分数，因此把字段回取压缩到最小集合。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>文档数</th>\n<th>主要开销</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Query Phase（打分收集）</td>\n<td>查询 + 倒排/norms</td>\n<td><code>TopDocs</code>（docID + score）</td>\n<td>扫描全部匹配，仅留 K</td>\n<td>迭代 + 打分 + 堆比较</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fetch Phase（字段回取）</td>\n<td>全局 Top-K docID</td>\n<td><code>_source</code> + stored fields</td>\n<td>恰好 K</td>\n<td><code>.fdt</code> 解压 + 网络往返</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这也解释了 <code>track_total_hits</code> 的行为：Elasticsearch 7 起默认只精确统计到 10000 个命中，超过即返回 <code>&quot;relation&quot;:&quot;gte&quot;</code>（见 <a href=\"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/search-your-data.html\">track_total_hits 文档</a>），因为精确总数会迫使收集阶段放弃阈值剪枝、退化为全量计数。运维上把 <code>size</code> 设得过大会同时抬高 Query Phase 的堆阈值与 Fetch Phase 的回取量，是查询变慢最常见的单一原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"collectormanager-与跨段并发\">CollectorManager 与跨段并发</h2><p><code>IndexSearcher</code> 暴露两套入口：<code>search(Query, Collector)</code> 单线程顺序遍历各段，<code>search(Query, CollectorManager)</code> 则让管理者决定<strong>并行度</strong>。<code>CollectorManager</code> 的契约是 <code>newCollector()</code> 每 slice 建一个独立收集器、各自维护 Top-K 堆，最后 <code>reduce(Collection&lt;C&gt;)</code> 归并成一个结果——归并成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>slice 数</mtext><mo>×</mo><mi>K</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\text{slice 数} \\times K \\log K)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">slice </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，远低于并行省下的迭代时间。Elasticsearch 据此实现 <strong>concurrent segment search</strong>：把分片请求按段切成 slice 并发执行再归并（见 <a href=\"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/search-your-data.html\">Elasticsearch 搜索阶段文档</a>），段多的小索引收益明显、单段大索引几乎没有，且因改变了归并路径，与 <code>terminate_after</code>、聚合组合时需留意语义差异。</p>\n<p>并发收集还带来两个显式资源契约：<strong>提前终止</strong>（<code>TimeLimitingCollector</code> / <code>ExitableDirectoryReader</code> 让迭代器在 <code>nextDoc</code>/<code>advance</code> 内部检查中断）与<strong>句柄释放</strong>（<code>ScorerSupplier</code> 打开的倒排链必须在收集结束时释放，这正是 <code>reduce</code> 必须覆盖全部 <code>newCollector</code> 结果的原因）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>三段契约</strong>：<code>Weight</code> 每查询一份（编译查询语义），<code>Scorer</code> 每段一份（段内前进 + 打分），<code>Collector</code> 每查询一份（决定保留什么）。三者生命周期不同，是理解流水线的第一把钥匙。</li>\n<li><strong>跳跃靠 <code>advance</code></strong>：<code>nextDoc()</code> 只能逐条走，<code>advance(target)</code> 才能跳过；跳跃能力来自 <code>.doc</code> 块编码的块头最大 docID 与块内二分。</li>\n<li><strong>打分惰性 + 上界剪枝</strong>：<code>score()</code> 只在入堆判定时才调用；WAND / block-max 用分数上界跳过整块文档，前提是相似度可被安全上界。</li>\n<li><strong>两阶段收集</strong>：Query Phase 只产出 <code>(docID, score)</code> 的 Top-K，Fetch Phase 才按 docID 解压 <code>.fdt</code> 取回字段；字段回取的量被压缩到恰好 K 个。</li>\n<li><strong>确定性与并发</strong>：堆比较器在分数相等时用 docID 兜底，保证分页稳定；<code>CollectorManager</code> 用「分段收集 + 归并」实现并发，代价是归并与资源释放契约。</li>\n<li><strong>可观测的代价点</strong>：<code>size</code> 过大同时抬高 Query 与 Fetch 两个阶段的成本，是慢查询最常见的原因；<code>track_total_hits</code> 设为精确会关闭阈值剪枝，退化为全量计数。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>配套阅读：段与倒排链的物理布局见 <a href=\"../lucene-segment-write-model/segment-anatomy-inverted-index-structure\">段文件解剖与不可变倒排索引结构</a>；term 到倒排链的定位过程见 <a href=\"../term-dictionary-encoding/fst-term-dictionary-term-index\">FST 词典与 term index</a>；写入与 refresh 如何决定有多少段可供本次查询遍历，见 <a href=\"../lucene-segment-write-model/write-path-buffer-refresh-flush-translog\">写入路径：buffer、refresh、flush 与 translog</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"查询执行流水线：倒排迭代器、scorer 与 collector 的两阶段收集","id":"查询执行流水线-倒排迭代器-scorer-与-collector-的两阶段收集"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：Weight / Scorer / Collector 的三个职责","id":"核心概念-weight-scorer-collector-的三个职责"},{"level":2,"text":"Weight 与 Scorer：把查询编译成迭代器树","id":"weight-与-scorer-把查询编译成迭代器树"},{"level":2,"text":"倒排迭代器：docID/nextDoc/advance 的三段式跳跃","id":"倒排迭代器-docid-nextdoc-advance-的三段式跳跃"},{"level":2,"text":"Scorer 打分：BM25 与上界驱动的跳过","id":"scorer-打分-bm25-与上界驱动的跳过"},{"level":2,"text":"两阶段收集：TopScoreDocCollector 与字段回取","id":"两阶段收集-topscoredoccollector-与字段回取"},{"level":2,"text":"CollectorManager 与跨段并发","id":"collectormanager-与跨段并发"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"BM25 打分模型：TF/IDF、norm 与字段权重","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/lucene-elasticsearch-engine-segments-inverted-index/search-scoring-execution/bm25-similarity-norms-score-model"},"next":{"title":"相关性调优与打分诊断：rescore、explain、深分页与慢查询定位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/lucene-elasticsearch-engine-segments-inverted-index/search-scoring-execution/rescore-explain-deep-pagination-diagnosis"}}